sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Admin regenerates the registry snapshot
  participant U as Admin
  participant C as Admin Console
  participant A as Express API
  participant S as Supabase
  participant G as Registry Service
  participant F as Filesystem
  participant L as Activity Log
  U->>C: Click Generate registry
  C->>A: POST /api/admin/registry/generate
  A->>S: read published templates + taxonomy
  S-->>A: rows
  A->>G: generateRegistry(rows, targetPath)
  G->>F: write site/registry.json
  F-->>G: written
  G-->>A: counts + generatedAt
  A->>L: record registry.generated
  A-->>C: 200 summary
  C-->>U: Show success
  Note over G: The snapshot is consumed by the static site build.
